	]
	quest.15A8E8A70630EC42.title: "Coral Seeds"
	quest.15A8E8A70630EC42.quest_subtitle: "Tier 2 crop"
	quest.15A8E8A70630EC42.quest_desc: [
		"&eWhat:&r coral seeds grow coral essence, which crafts back into coral."
		"&eHow:&r a prosperity seed base on the Infusion Altar, with prudentium essence and the crop's materials on the pedestals (check JEI)."
		"&eChemistry:&r real coral skeletons are calcium carbonate, CaCO₃, laid down by tiny animals."
		"&eTip:&r one seed is enough: plant it and every harvest has a chance to drop another."
