		"&eHow:&r a prosperity seed base on the Infusion Altar, with imperium essence and the crop's materials on the pedestals (check JEI). It also needs an MI electronic circuit (MV)."
		"&eChemistry:&r electrum is a natural gold-silver alloy; the first coins were struck from it."
		"&eTip:&r one seed is enough: plant it and every harvest has a chance to drop another."
	]
	quest.3BDAA0E3110DFF26.title: "Invar Seeds"
	quest.3BDAA0E3110DFF26.quest_subtitle: "Tier 4 crop"
	quest.3BDAA0E3110DFF26.quest_desc: [
		"&eWhat:&r invar seeds grow invar essence, which crafts back into invar."
		"&eHow:&r a prosperity seed base on the Infusion Altar, with imperium essence and the crop's materials on the pedestals (check JEI). It also needs an MI electronic circuit (MV)."
		"&eChemistry:&r invar is iron with about 36% nickel, and barely expands when heated."
		"&eTip:&r one seed is enough: plant it and every harvest has a chance to drop another."
	]
