	quest.6049C9BF19F654C9.quest_subtitle: "Tier 4 mob crop"
	quest.6049C9BF19F654C9.quest_desc: [
		"&eWhat:&r blaze seeds grow blaze essence, which crafts back into blaze rods."
		"&eHow:&r a prosperity seed base on the Infusion Altar, with imperium essence and a full Soul Jar of that mob on the pedestals (check JEI). It also needs an MI electronic circuit (MV)."
		"&eTip:&r one seed is enough: plant it and every harvest has a chance to drop another."
	]
