		"&eTip:&r basic blocks still need no Orb: basic capacitors are iron, paste and a redstone block."
	]
	quest.354774525777C4A9.title: "Basic Reactor"
	quest.354774525777C4A9.quest_subtitle: "Uraninite-fuelled multiblock"
	quest.354774525777C4A9.quest_desc: [
		"&eWhat:&r 36 basic reactor blocks: a real Powah reactor, fuelled by the uraninite you oxidised yourself."
		"&eChemistry:&r uraninite is UO₂. Its U-235 splits when it absorbs a neutron, releasing heat and more neutrons; the reactor turns that heat into FE."
		"&eHow:&r 4 starter reactor blocks, 4 large capacitors and a uraninite make 4 (check JEI). Stack them and they form one reactor."
		"&eTip:&r fuel, temperature and coolant all show in its GUI. Watch the temperature as you scale up."
	]
	quest.3780F427CC70F268.title: "Basic Solar Panel"
	quest.3780F427CC70F268.quest_subtitle: "Basic tier: solar panel"
	quest.3780F427CC70F268.quest_desc: [
		"&eWhat:&r the Solar Panel makes FE from daylight."
		"&eHow:&r usually the starter solar panel with basic capacitors; JEI has the exact recipe."
		"&eTip:&r basic blocks still need no Orb: basic capacitors are iron, paste and a redstone block."
	]
	quest.13B90E45A26449BB.title: "Hardened Energy Discharger"
	quest.13B90E45A26449BB.quest_subtitle: "Hardened tier: energy discharger"
	quest.13B90E45A26449BB.quest_desc: [
		"&eWhat:&r the Energy Discharger pulls FE back out of items placed in it and sends it on to the grid."
		"&eHow:&r usually the basic energy discharger with energized steel and hardened capacitors; JEI has the exact recipe."
		"&eTip:&r hardened parts start from energized steel, made in the Energizing Orb."
	]
